            <div class="content-text">
                
                <ul><li><strong>Qualification:</strong> CA with valid Certificate of Practice from ICAI. Firm: registered with ICAI, majority partners practicing CAs.</li><li><strong>Independence:</strong> No financial interest in company or its group. No securities held.</li><li><strong>Relationship:</strong> Not director, relative of director, or employee of company.</li><li><strong>Indebtedness:</strong> Personal debt <Rs 5 lakh. Guarantee for third party <Rs 1 lakh.</li><li><strong>Audit Ceiling:</strong> Maximum 20 companies for individual CA.</li><li><strong>Conviction:</strong> No fraud conviction in last 10 years.</li><li><strong>Auto-Vacancy:</strong> If disqualified after appointment, deemed vacated automatically.</li></ul>

