                <p><strong>S.139(1):</strong> Subsequent at AGM. 5-year term. Consent + S.141 + ADT-1.</p><p><strong>S.139(6):</strong> First auditor. Board 30 days. EGM 90 days if Board fails.</p><p><strong>S.139(2):</strong> Rotation. Individual 1×5. Firm 2×5. 5-year cooling-off.</p><p><strong>S.141:</strong> Eligibility. CA with COP. Independent. Audit ceiling 20.</p><p><strong>ADT-1:</strong> ROC 15 days. All types. 2025: mandatory for first auditor.</p><p><strong>S.140:</strong> Removal. SR + Central Govt ADT-2. Auditor heard.</p><p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://mca.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mca.gov.in</a>, Companies Act 2013</p>

